<div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:300px;"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-4712/Store"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/scp-4712/Store/medium.jpg" style="width:300px;" alt="Store" class="image" /></a>
